sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant W as Web app
  participant API
  participant DB as Database
  U->>W: Open page
  activate W
  W->>+API: GET /items
  Note right of API: Checks the session
  alt signed in
    API->>DB: SELECT items
    DB-->>API: rows
    API-->>W: 200 items
  else not signed in
    API-->>W: 401
  end
  deactivate API
  loop every 30s
    W->>API: poll
  end
  opt has draft
    W->>W: restore draft
  end
  par to API
    W-)API: telemetry
  and to user
    W--)U: toast
  end
  critical write
    API->>DB: INSERT
  option conflict
    API->>API: retry
  end
  break on failure
    API--xW: 500
  end
  rect rgb(200, 220, 255)
    Note over W,API: Highlighted region
  end
  Note left of U: Sees result
  deactivate W
